{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/Header.png?t=1748152746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/Separation_Line.png?t=1748152746\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ranch has been burnt down, but there are traces of the perpetrator &quot;EquinoCorp&quot; at the scene! You set off into the city to investigate the mystery behind its destruction, and to get revenge while somewhat helping out others along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single-player narrative game where you play as a quirky wannabe cowboy exploring the dystopian futuristic world for his own revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/Trailer.gif?t=1748152746\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/Separation_Line.png?t=1748152746\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A Linear Story with Branching Narrative Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Wonderful Cast of Characters (including yourself as the titular Cowboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Interrogating suspects and chasing leads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A variety of mini-games to shake up the pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Animated cutscenes for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/Separation_Line.png?t=1748152746\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea